1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,000
- Is the boat ready?
- Almost.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,000
<i>- We leave at noon.</i>
<i>- Who said so?</i>

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:09,000
- The captain did.
- Then we wait, until the wind turns.

4
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:12,000
A slow - and cold - crossing.

5
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:15,000
I think I'm ready, but i.e. not today.

6
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:18,000
<i>So we stay.</i> Fine.

7
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:21,000
♪ We sail out at noon ♪

8
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:24,000
He said "tomorrow" twice.

9
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:27,000
Twice? Are you sure?...
